{"explanation":"The state stores current time, token, deadline, approvals, and connection. Before each event, an unconnected offer expiring at the current time is cleared. Offers replace all session data; valid accepts accumulate unique configured parties; the second approval connects permanently. Cancels clear only a matching current session.","mapping":"The outside rule maps to bounded session state: output is a reduced, event-visible representation of the fuller internal lifecycle. This transfer is appropriate only for retaining deadline, identity, approval, and connection distinctions required by the target contract.","assumptions":"Inputs satisfy the stated legal JSON constraints. Config is available on initialization; subsequent calls provide the returned state. Party IDs are ASCII, so ordinary lexical sorting matches required scalar ordering.","applies":"function applies(input){return !!input&&!!input.config&&Array.isArray(input.events)&&input.config.parties&&input.config.parties.length===2}","holds":"function holds(input,output){if(!Array.isArray(output)||output.length!==input.events.length)return false;for(const x of output){if(!x||x.connected==='__changed'||!Array.isArray(x.approved)||typeof x.status!=='string'||typeof x.now!=='number'||typeof x.expired!=='boolean'||!('token'in x)||!('expires'in x))return false}return true}","program":"function solve({config,state,event}){
  let s=state;
  if(s===null)s={ttl:config.ttl,ps:[config.parties[0],config.parties[1]],now:0,token:null,expires:null,approved:[],connected:null};
  let expired=false;
  if(s.expires!==null&&s.now>=s.expires){s.token=null;s.expires=null;s.approved=[];s.connected=null;expired=true}
  let status='ignored',t=event&&event.type;
  if(t==='advance'){
    s.now+=event.dt;
    if(s.expires!==null&&s.now>=s.expires){s.token=null;s.expires=null;s.approved=[];s.connected=null;expired=true}
    status='advanced';
  }else if(t==='offer'){
    s.token=event.token;s.expires=s.now+s.ttl;s.approved=[];s.connected=null;status='offered';
  }else if(t==='accept'){
    if(s.token!==null&&s.connected===null&&event.token===s.token&&(event.party===s.ps[0]||event.party===s.ps[1])){
      if(s.approved.indexOf(event.party)>=0)status='duplicate';
      else{s.approved.push(event.party);s.approved.sort();status='accepted';if(s.approved.length===2){s.connected=s.token;s.expires=null;status='connected'}}
    }
  }else if(t==='cancel'){
    if(s.token!==null&&event.token===s.token){s.token=null;s.expires=null;s.approved=[];s.connected=null;status='cancelled'}
  }
  return {state:s,output:{status:status,now:s.now,token:s.token,expires:s.expires,approved:s.approved.slice(),connected:s.connected,expired:expired}};
}"}
